          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مطمئن شدن (motma'en shodan) — \"to make sure, to become sure\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "قبل از رفتن مطمئن شدم که در قفل است. qabl az raftan motma'en shodam ke dar qofl ast. Before leaving I made sure that the door was locked."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Motma'en \"sure\" + shodan. Motma'en budan — to be sure. It is spelled with ئ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مطمئن comes from Arabic muṭma'inn \"calm, sure\" (EtymDB); with the inherited Persian verb shodan \"to become\", it means to become sure."
            }
          ]
        },
